# 17. OMS

The internal OMS is the canonical application order state.

Example lifecycle:

```text
SCANNED
→ CANDIDATE
→ QUALIFIED
→ RISK_CHECK
→ ORDER_PENDING
→ PARTIALLY_FILLED
→ FILLED
→ MANAGED
→ SCALE_OUT
→ EXIT
→ CLOSED
```

Broker IDs must be linked to internal order IDs.

Use idempotency.

Never assume a broker response is the complete source of truth for the application's state.

Always support reconciliation.

